2mfvhfDCd1jJNju5G155hX.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4185840707964602,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":31493,\"title\":\"The Real Housewives of D.C.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uXkmzijKgBYAkeXas453ZrQxnNg.jpg\",\"rating\":4,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4176470588235294,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":59556,\"title\":\"The Real Housewives of Vancouver\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uVa6mO1m3DRgFa9fE4K9KtqUeaP.jpg\",\"rating\":3.9,\"year\":2012,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4161290322580645,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":217065,\"title\":\"The Real Housewives of Cape Town\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mmtErozdP0z0hdNjcMvek8hNaKE.jpg\",\"rating\":3,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.41285714285714287,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":275387,\"title\":\"The Real Housewives of London\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/38prd9zV2sH6SXp3E8qNZ4LT0g9.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4118421052631579,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":282461,\"title\":\"The Real Housewives van het Zuiden\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vtARZBbYpRBOQHpS4kb2Qidg0jz.jpg\",\"rating\":2,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4116883116883117,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":110381,\"title\":\"The Real Housewives of Salt Lake City\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/57DhzlJaKkkx2RlbH7Epb8P8YFJ.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4115384615384616,\"_genreOverlap\":1}],\"seasonNumber\":9,\"seasonName\":\"Season 9\",\"seasonOverview\":\"\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zhdBov2g2Hm9cgWDgvV2LM2hPnH.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2018-11-07\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Wives and Misdemeanors\",\"overview\":\"With less than a year left in Joe's prison sentence, Teresa comes into her own and decides to enter a bodybuilding competition. Margaret feels the effects of aging. Dolores struggles to forgive Frank. Melissa celebrates her birthday.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eI83zTHQSQEavYDnCQSCs5rk1VQ.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-11-07\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Easter Wives Hunt\",\"overview\":\"Dolores hosts a hatchet throwing party, giving the ladies a chance to take out some serious aggression. Teresa reignites the Gorga/Giudice feud by criticizing her brother. Margaret prepares for an important business trip as her mother gets ready for a facelift.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aCJJhNUohYriaiVgg5bNh9QccP0.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-11-14\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"The Jersey Breakfast Club\",\"overview\":\"As tensions mount between Melissa and Teresa, all the ladies head out on a girls’ trip to a cattle ranch in Oklahoma. Jackie shares shocking personal details and Melissa reveals a family secret, leading Teresa to explode and forcing all the ladies to choose sides in an epic argument between the two sisters-in-law.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sMyP2NAfoboGQscXi6Jwvy65Xm5.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-11-21\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Housewives & Heifers\",\"overview\":\"As their Oklahoma trip continues, the ladies compete in a cattle show. Margaret's husband takes care of an increasingly demanding Marge Sr. while Teresa questions whether Joe and Melissa care enough about family. Later, Jennifer insults Margaret's friend Polly, causing Margaret to lose her cool.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xgUAy8gDrK048d8oCrxe2JsIisx.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-11-28\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Turkish Delights\",\"overview\":\"Teresa and Joe Gorga spar over their father. Dolores tries to help her mother improve her health. Melissa reveals to her sisters, that there may be a potential 4th sister. Jackie defends Melissa, igniting Teresa's famous temper and shocking the entire group with a surprising accusation.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aEfVMuUrlb4Ga1M8jUpQjRMv9Ju.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-12-05\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Last Fling Before the Ring\",\"overview\":\"Dolores catches Frank in another lie. Jackie considers reconciling with her sister; Melissa plans little Joey's communion. Margaret, Melissa and Teresa plan Danielle's bachelorette party, but Danielle's ways lead to an explosive confrontation.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4iDjJz11BYxZ2eMCwRVZBd2nUf9.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-12-12\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Brunch Gone Bad\",\"overview\":\"Margaret hosts a brunch leading to a big blowup; Teresa, Melissa, Joe Gorga, and Margaret head to Danielle's wedding, but tensions run high between Teresa and her brother. Melissa worries their family drama could ruin Danielle's special day.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/n5bWzHJSnEKmjRoAFHvyFQK9K9w.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-12-19\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Bridezilla of Bimini\",\"overview\":\"Tensions between Margaret and Danielle rise as Danielle’s wedding demands drive Margaret wild. As Jennifer’s family celebrates her brother’s engagement, Jackie meets with Dolores to try to understand what makes Teresa tick.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yj7xt7ByvlECBLQChkMrh4OB3tr.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-12-26\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Communion and Confession\",\"overview\":\"The feud between Teresa and Jackie threatens to upset Joey's communion; Jennifer is offended when she learns that Jackie has written an article about her family. Dolores plans an event for a homeless shelter; Milania copes with her detained father.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lD2tfFJmjigLRUowOKmKdXYDoTg.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-01-02\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"From Turkey With Love\",\"overview\":\"Jennifer departs for Turkey to celebrate her brother's engagement; Danielle sends Margaret a text that could end their friendship; Dolores hosts a charity event. Melissa finds out how Joe feels about their daughter taking over the family business.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9vF2Oo2drEKFOj7hAbFHeIDwu1R.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-01-09\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Whine Country\",\"overview\":\"Jackie hosts a trip to a vineyard for some much-needed bonding time; Jennifer attacks Jackie for writing an article about her family. Margaret calls Jennifer's brother's fiancé a “mail-order bride;” Teresa throws a song release party for Milania.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4txExaM71CxOewxOu4V6bF8gXv9.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-01-16\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"Mudslinging in Mexico\",\"overview\":\"Teresa's fitness competition is finally here; Melissa makes a surprising discovery about her parents' marriage. As the ladies take off for Cabo, Mexico, tensions between Margaret and Danielle threaten to ruin the entire trip.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kwsAWvkaxBSxXPGgUEvmVefajUC.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-01-23\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":13,\"name\":\"Camels, Cabo & Catfights\",\"overview\":\"As the Cabo trip continues, Teresa reveals her true feelings about Joe returning home; the ladies are forced to take sides after Margaret throws out shocking accusations about Jennifer. Danielle tries to get Teresa on her good side.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lbpBVU6cz7FrCtZQX7JavbMiBF9.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-01-30\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":14,\"name\":\"Heroines in Heels\",\"overview\":\"After a night of confrontations and one broken glass, the ladies return home with a clear division between the group. As Margaret prepares for her Hospital Heroes event, Melissa continues to search for answers about her father.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pHmsigNy4pwTEPu5UowRHkZTYXe.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-02-06\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":15,\"name\":\"Hotheads and Hookahs\",\"overview\":\"Dolores makes an important decision about Frank. Melissa's search for her sister leads to a shocking discovery. Jennifer's anniversary party becomes the site of a final group showdown as the ladies try to convince Teresa to remove Danielle from their social circle.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wh5VW74Wo4OltCLO0fWd8wl9nEH.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-02-13\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":16,\"name\":\"Reunion Part 1\",\"overview\":\"Margaret and Jennifer exchange heated words while addressing their ongoing conflict; Teresa accuses Jackie of having ulterior motives for joining the show, and she makes it clear that she will never forgive what Jackie said about her husband.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iZLD1CfTmJJK7UKD6zsAJZlfmTN.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-02-20\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":17,\"name\":\"Reunion Part 2\",\"overview\":\"Jackie and Teresa's argument boils over; Joe and Melissa defend themselves against Teresa's accusations; Jennifer defends her parenting and her marriage; Teresa shocks Andy and the ladies when she reveals her true feelings about Joe's deportation.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/81JYq0ghHIIdJoemGtjcD5MZNrl.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-02-27\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":18,\"name\":\"Reunion Part 3\",\"overview\":\"Teresa addresses the state of her marriage; the men join their wives for some fun, but the levity is short lived when Danielle's feud with Margaret escalates.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mcFl9KDRRmIeidk6ifFu8gNlo8f.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-03-06\",\"runtime\":43}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2009-05-12\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}